        .marketing-avatar AB
        .marketing-crew-row__copy
          %strong Avery Brooks
          %span A1 Audio Engineer
        %span.marketing-crew-reason Occupation + skills
      .marketing-crew-row
        .marketing-avatar.marketing-avatar--sky MK
        .marketing-crew-row__copy
          %strong Morgan Kim
          %span Lighting Programmer
        %span.marketing-crew-reason Skills + equipment
      .marketing-crew-row
        .marketing-avatar.marketing-avatar--navy JT
        .marketing-crew-row__copy
          %strong Jordan Torres
          %span Video Engineer
        %span.marketing-crew-reason Role + location
    .marketing-preview-note
      %i.bi.bi-stars
      Search real experience. See why people match. Confirm the details together.
